HDR screens: back to normal after sleep

A screen always in HDR (Hyprland cm = "hdr") can wake washed out until its
HDR is turned off and on again. On waking, run arashos-settings wake, which
does that for each such screen once it is back on. Hyprland has no event
for waking; Caelestia already listens to logind for it.

--- a/modules/IdleMonitors.qml
+++ b/modules/IdleMonitors.qml
@@ -54,6 +54,12 @@
             root.lock.lock.unlock();
         }
 
+        // ArashOS: a screen always in HDR can wake washed out until its HDR
+        // is turned off and on again (arashos-settings wake does that).
+        function onResumed(): void {
+            Quickshell.execDetached(["arashos-settings", "wake"]);
+        }
+
         target: SessionManager
     }
 
